  "body": "The keeper house's existing east gable triangle now uses its wall material instead of roof shingles. The roof envelope, openings, vertex attributes and unpictured west end stay exact. This recovers the stopped native worker's actual saved build; T-2380 remains open/partial.\n\n### Native and image evidence\n\nPinned Blender4.5.3 genuinely rebuilt272 frame-dwelling defaults before the early c453 checkpoint;271 MASTERs were byte-identical and only the keeper received a new WEB. Independent full-attribute triangle review confirms one material assignment changes. Both fixed comparison records remain DIFFERS; the Gale end is nearly edge-on and the Andreas compound is distant. [Full native ZIP, hashes, exact saved34a source, pairs and independent audit](https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/49239fcd6898b180969e38651a677414274e7941/evidence/log-jail-2026-11-04/keeper-east-gable-native272-saved34a-quota-and-final-gaps/RECOVERY.md). ROADMAP and STATUS receive append-only checkpoints preserving their complete archived prefixes.\n\n### Verification and remaining work\n\nActual source2/3 passed292 each after the owner's derived-liberties fix. Source1's earlier RED and source4's Python3.14/NumPy2.5 cross2D RED remain recorded; no local all-four PASS is claimed. Authenticated check.sh invokes the real publisher in every partition, so the post-fix source2/3 PASS and source4's sole unrelated failure support the nested34a publication chain before the actual mobile3\u20134 139/0. No separate published-input map/buildstamp was captured. The appended documentation passed its actual whitespace/changelog-entry/ID-collision preflight; full current-head hosted8 plus aggregate are still required.\n\nDraft while integrating current dev and finishing genuinely published keeper east-body review at desktop1280\u00d7800 and phone390\u00d7780, the missing desktop/relevant runtime and current-head gates. Exact prior Sources/Images may carry only after consumed-row equality. No full historical picture match, camera/grade promotion, passage/ground acceptance or completed original ticket is claimed. No rebake is needed for unchanged recipe inputs.\n\nThe local claim used the documented --force stale-own-run exception after verifying native417901 completed at provider quota and no live T-2380 PR. This is not a forcepush or a live-owner takeover. Final ordinary dev merge waits for the actual required evidence; no auto-merge bypass.\n",
